# Everything Projucer generates from EQ.jucer -- the Xcode project, the
# Info plists, and the compiled output. EQ.jucer is the single source of
# truth: open it in Projucer to regenerate all of this. (Committing the
# .xcodeproj without JuceLibraryCode/ would give a project that can't
# build anyway, so it's all-or-nothing -- and "all" is 1.4GB.)
EQ/Builds/

# Xcode per-user state (breakpoints, window layout) -- machine-specific,
# not part of the project.
**/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcuserstate

# Also Projucer-generated (see above).
EQ/JuceLibraryCode/

# Working notes for AI-assisted development sessions -- not documentation
# for humans, and it goes stale fast. README.md is the doc for readers.
EQ/CLAUDE.md

# macOS
.DS_Store
